  "fullContentHtml": "\n<div class=\"ast-post-format- single-layout-1 ast-no-date-box\" style=\"height: auto !important;\">\n\n<p><!-- .entry-header --></p>\n<div class=\"entry-content clear\" style=\"height: auto !important;\">\n<div class=\"post-desc\">\n<p><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 13pt;\"><span style=\"color: #ff0000;\"><strong>Short Information :</strong> </span> </span><span style=\"color: #000000;\">has released the mains exam fees payment for the Post of <span style=\"font-size: 13pt;\"><strong>Ayurvedic Pharmacists</strong></span><strong>&nbsp;posts</strong>. This <span class=\"google-anno-t\">recruitment</span>&nbsp;was released for&nbsp;<strong data-start=\"890\" data-end=\"903\">1002 posts</strong>. Applications for the UPSSSC Pharmacist Ayurvedic <span class=\"google-anno-t\">Recruitment</span> 2026 were accepted from <span style=\"font-size: 13pt;\"><strong data-start=\"733\" data-end=\"829\">12 February 2024</strong>, to<strong data-start=\"856\" data-end=\"878\"> 03 March 2024</strong></span><strong>.</strong>&nbsp;The examination is going to conducted on&nbsp;<strong>20 September 2026</strong>. Candidates who had applied this form can download their&nbsp;<strong>UPSSSC <span style=\"font-size: 13pt;\">Ayurvedic Pharmacists</span> Pay Mains Exam Fees Payment 2026</strong>&nbsp;from the link given below.</span></p>\n</div>\n<div class=\"newtable1\">\n<table style=\"font-size: 16px; font-style: normal; width: 100%;\" width=\"100%\">\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"4\" width=\"100%\">\n<h2 style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #ff0000;\">Uttar Pradesh Subordinate Services Selection Commission (UPSSSC)</span></h2>\n<h2 style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #008000;\">UPSSSC Pharmacist Ayurvedic Mains Exam Fees Payment 2026&nbsp;</span></h2>\n<h2 style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #ff0000;\">UPSSSC Advt No:- 01 Exam 2024</span></h2>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"pd-0\" colspan=\"4\" width=\"100%\">