on 2024 : Age Limit</strong></span></h3>\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\"><strong>Age Limit As On 01 July 2024</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">Minimum Age : <strong>18 Years</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">Maximum Age :&nbsp;<strong>40 Years</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">Age Relaxation as per UPSSSC Pharmacist Ayurvedic Recruitment Rules.</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\">Use <span style=\"background-color: #ffff00;\"> </span>Tool –</span> </span></li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"pd-0\" colspan=\"4\" width=\"100%\">\n<h3 style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><strong>UPSSSC Pharmacist Ayurvedic </strong></span><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><strong>2024 : Vacancy Details</strong></span></h3>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #ff0000;\"><strong>Total Posts : 1002 Posts</strong></span></p>\n<table style=\"border-collapse: collapse; width: 100%;\">\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 44.6579%; text-align: center;\"><strong><span style=\"color: #000000;\">Post Name</span></strong></td>\n<td style=\"width: 28.7832%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>Category</strong></span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 26.5588%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>No. of Posts</strong></span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 44.6579%; text-align: center;\" rowspan=\"5\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\">Pharmacist Ayurvedic</span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 28.7832%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">General</span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 26.5588%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">448</span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 28.7832%; text-align: center;\"><span style=