n below</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">Then the candidates must click on the Exam Date link.&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">After clicking on the link, the candidates will be redirected to a new page.</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">In this page, candidates have to enter the following details:</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">Registration no.</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>Login ID</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>Birth Date/Password</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>Captcha Code</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">Then the candidates have to&nbsp; submit the details by clicking on the Login button.</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">After successful login, candidates will be able to download the exam date.</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">Alternatively, the candidates can download the exam date from the official website of UPSSSC also.</span></li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"pd-0\" colspan=\"4\" width=\"100%\">\n<h3 style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><strong>UPSSSC Pharmacist Ayurvedic Recruitment 2024 : Mode of Selection</strong></span></h3>\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">Shortlisting (PET 2023 Score)</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">Written Examination</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">Medical Examination</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">Document Verification</span></li>\n</ul>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\">[adinserter block=”3″]</p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n</div>\n<div class=\"newtable2\">\n<table style=\"width: 100%;\">\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"has-text-align-center\" style=\"text-align: center; 